Dialogue: 6,0:21:06.78,0:21:10.30,JP,,0,0,0,,{\fscx50}　{\fscx}もう少しだけ{\fscx50}　{\fscx0} {\fscx50}　{\fscx}眺めててもいいですか{\fscx50}　{\fscx}
Dialogue: 6,0:21:16.89,0:21:18.36,JP,,0,0,0,,そうね
Dialogue: 6,0:21:27.61,0:21:31.93,JP,,0,0,0,,{\fscx50}　{\fscx}聖地巡礼初めてやったけど{\fscx50}　{\fscx0} {\fscx50}　{\fscx}結構楽しかったね{\fscx50}　{\fscx}
